OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after cyclist, 16, fatally
OL,4,Astruck by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 16-year-old cyclist has died and a
OL,7,Fman arrested after the teenager's bike
OL,8,Fwas struck by a car.
OL,10,FThe collision happened on Friday at the
OL,11,Fjunction of Cattell Road and
OL,12,FTemplefield Street in the Small Heath
OL,13,Farea of Birmingham, near the Birmingham
OL,14,FCity stadium.
OL,16,FThe boy was taken to hospital with
OL,17,Fserious injuries but died on Saturday,
OL,18,FWest Midlands Police said.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
