OL,3,GNEWSAArrest after cyclist, 16, fatally
OL,4,Astruck by car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man, aged 47, was arrested on
OL,7,FSaturday on suspicion of causing death
OL,8,Fby dangerous driving, and he remains in
OL,9,Fpolice custody. The force has asked for
OL,10,Fwitnesses to the collision, which
OL,11,Fhappened at about 05:25 BST.
